WEBVTT

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.040
She's coming.

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:24.290
This fog's worse than the rumours.

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:29.540
But because of the fog in the Calibara Forest it seems that they're having trouble transporting medicine to the region.

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:32.880
I heard there wasn't any fog in that area in the past.

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:36.260
I hear that monsters have come to live in the forest.

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:38.170
The Calibara Forest...

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:50.730
Great, I wanted to investigate the source of this fog, but I can't do that if I'm lost, can I?

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:20.930
I've brought them, Sun Dancer.

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:22.760
Sun Dancer.

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:28.270
Wait here.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:37.900
What? Is it morning already?

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:41.150
I'm going to sleep a little longer.

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:42.950
The knight is here.

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.490
What? She's here?!

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:48.240
Welcome, Knight!

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:50.660
My name is Lunaluna.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:52.290
What type of hobbies do you have?

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.460
What do you like to eat?

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:55.460
How many children do you want?

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:56.170
What?

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:59.170
You're cute when you blush, too.

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:01.840
I'm not really blushing here...

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:04.510
How about putting on some clothes?

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:10.810
Silly, Knight. Oh, you.

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:13.440
She's not...

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:17.980
much different from when she wasn't wearing any clothes...

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:21.240
Sorry about before.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:23.950
I was so happy I finally got to meet you.

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:25.360
Finally?

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:28.620
Actually, where are you taking me?

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:32.500
These are the sacred Calibara ruins.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:33.250
Ruins?

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:37.290
We'll be there shortly.

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:43.510
What the...

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:46.180
Hey, what is...

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:01.150
The Calibara ruins...

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:02.400
What's that?

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:07.620
A god lives here.

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:09.580
It's the entrance to the Temple Room.

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:13.080
Even amongst the people of the Calibara tribe,

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:15.580
only dancers and the village elder

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:17.170
may enter this sacred space.

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.560
This is...

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:18.020
Pretty cool, don't you think?

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:20.400
Y-Yeah.

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:24.940
Who would have thought there'd be

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.860
something like this in ancient ruins?

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:28.360
Those who protect,

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:29.860
those who have been entrusted,

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:31.240
and those who pray...

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:33.780
When united under a just light,

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:36.830
a great power will illuminate the future.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:37.370
Huh?

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:39.670
It's a poem told by the ruins.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:42.920
I don't really get it either, but...

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:45.710
But why did you bring me here...

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:48.800
This place is sacred, right? But...

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:55.060
Well, I wanted to show the god of the ruins first...

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:56.060
Show?

00:06:56.180 --> 00:07:01.850
Well, you're going to become my husband, so...

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:03.190
Huh?

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:05.320
I had a premonition!

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:06.570
In it, I saw that a knight was

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:07.990
to soon come to our village,

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:09.950
and that person would be "the one."

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:11.570
So, so, so...

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:12.910
B-But...

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:14.280
I'm a woman.

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:14.780
Huh?

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:19.870
Check...

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:22.670
Yeah, not there.

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:28.260
No! It's all wrong!

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:33.340
I apologize deeply.

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:36.890
She was certain that the fated person

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:40.560
from her premonition was a man.

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:42.650
I'm not really bothered.

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:45.230
Anyway, about the fog in the forest...

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:51.280
Oh, actually, I've prepared a banquet to apologize.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:52.410
No, I...

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:54.660
Everyone!

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:04.960
Please eat and drink your fill.

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:07.550
Eat, eat. Drink, drink.

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:09.590
I don't really drink...

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:28.730
Have you awoken?

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:33.150
What are you trying...

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:38.450
You now know the secret of the ruins.

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:41.910
This is for the village.

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:43.540
Please understand.

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:47.590
We'll give you as much food or any other essentials you desire.

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:51.630
W-Wait!

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:52.340
Hey!

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:59.010
How could this happen?

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:18.820
I see.

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:22.160
Looks like we can't just leave you be.

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:30.670
Wh-Who are you?!

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:34.050
I kind of like the look on your face.

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:36.510
Did you come here to kill me

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:38.840
because I found out about the ruins?

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:41.350
Quite morbid, aren't we?

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:43.390
I'm actually here for the opposite.

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:44.480
Huh?

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:45.980
So cute...

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:47.650
It's going to be absolutely wonderful to see

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:49.310
the expression on your face twist and change,

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:52.900
through pleasure.

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:56.150
And...

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:58.530
What do we have next...

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:02.950
What are you doing Moonlight Dancer?!

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:33.690
What is it?

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:38.070
Nothing.

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:39.820
I can't get worked up over

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:43.830
some girl that's sitting here locked up.

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:45.540
Not to mention...

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:49.160
If you slack off on your guard duty,

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:50.790
I'm going to make you wear this and

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:54.000
make it so you can't do anything bad ever again!

00:10:57.130 --> 00:11:00.760
I totally don't want to wear that thing.

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:03.760
Why did you come here anyway?

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:06.350
To figure out the source of the fog.

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:08.930
Did some bureaucrat hire you or something?

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:11.270
No, I hear there were people in trouble because

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:13.400
they couldn't get goods shipped through the fog.

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:14.610
That's it?

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:15.520
Yes.

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:18.860
Even though you're not going to earn a single bit of gold?

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:22.780
I thought it was the most I could do at the moment.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:26.240
How ridiculous.

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:33.750
And now you're stuck, locked up here until you die.

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:35.250
Maybe so.

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:37.800
Good night.

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:44.140
I can't let things end like this.

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:50.310
I need to find a way to escape.

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:08.160
Is the Dancer watching her properly?

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:12.040
I brought down some food not too long ago

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:13.330
and didn't see any problems.

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:18.170
I bet I scared her good.

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:19.000
Scared her?

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:22.420
I told her that if she messed up,

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:26.680
she'd have to do the one thing she hates the most.

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:29.890
I'm sure she'll be fine for a little while, at least.

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:31.100
Huh?!

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:34.310
Why? Why isn't she here?!

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:37.560
She's not here!

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:39.860
Now the elder is going to...

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:51.040
Why did you come back?

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:53.000
I overheard.

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:53.710
Huh?

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:57.210
It was not my intent to get you severely

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:58.710
punished because of me.

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:01.880
I'll think of a different way to get away.

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:03.550
H-How...

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:08.550
How cute!

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:09.390
Wai—

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:12.220
you said you couldn't get excited over a girl that's locked up!

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:15.640
It's your fault for being so cute.

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:17.150
To thank you, I'll make you feel so good

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:19.400
you'll think you're in heaven.

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:21.230
Ahem!

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:33.080
Seriously...

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.710
I'll let you off this time,

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:38.960
but you are not to approach the knight again.

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:41.500
Understood, Moonlight Dancer?

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:43.260
Yes...

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:48.050
So I just don't have to be the Moonlight Dancer, right?

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:14.290
You're...

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:22.420
What's the matter?

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:23.800
Did something happen?

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:31.430
What happened?

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:32.930
What is this?

00:14:35.970 --> 00:14:37.680
Were you surprised?

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:40.650
The Sun Dancer and the Moonlight Dancer

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:43.770
are both actually me!

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:46.990
Now, then...

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:50.740
W-What are you...

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:55.410
The Sun Dancer was the one who approached you...

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:58.620
But it's my job to have fun with you.

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:08.170
You taste so good...

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:11.300
Don't resist so much.

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:15.180
Your body soon won't be able to live without me.

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:18.180
Oh, what's this?

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:21.900
Well, aren't you aggressive?

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:24.730
That's my...

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:28.690
You just can't wait, can you?

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:29.280
Huh?

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:33.030
Huh?!

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.720
What is this?

00:15:58.140 --> 00:16:00.180
They're attacking the village!

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:01.640
Don't let it get there!

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:06.690
Wait!  Take me, too!

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:14.410
Don't let it get close to the ruins!

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:17.200
We have to protect the temple from the monsters!

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:36.930
Sorry, but I don't like to dance on top of monsters.

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:50.530
I thank you, Moonlight Dancer!

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:57.120
That is so gross!

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.130
Are you okay?!

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:09.540
How just of you.

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:11.590
You didn't run away and came to help.

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:13.630
A given for a knight.

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:17.800
I don't mind you being so chivalrous either.

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:20.100
Maybe I should reward you.

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:46.460
W-What is that?!

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:48.000
What's going on?!

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:53.510
The fog...

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:55.670
This is what's causing the fog?

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:05.520
I'm not letting some monster do

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:08.020
anything to our sacred ruins!

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:49.690
Get out of here while you can!

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:51.730
There's no reason for you to put your life on the line for this!

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:54.690
I'm just doing everything I can do!

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:58.360
I won't let anyone die while I'm around any longer!

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:08.810
A great power...

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:20.280
Thank you. You've done a lot for me.

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:23.410
No, you really saved us.

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:25.990
You protected the village, the Dancer,

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:29.620
and the ruins after putting your life on the line.

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:33.040
You don't have to be so polite.

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:35.540
It just happened that clearing the fog

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:38.000
and saving the village overlapped.

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:41.880
The Elder tells me to give his regards, as well.

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:45.470
Oh yeah, what is the Elder and the dancer doing?

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:47.010
Well, they're...

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:53.350
So I can go chase after her?

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:57.020
I don't want to admit it, but I guess I have to.

00:20:57.810 --> 00:21:01.990
It seems that she is the fated person

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:04.320
in your premonition.

00:21:04.570 --> 00:21:06.490
Thank you, Elder!

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:08.030
I knew you'd understand!

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:09.910
Anyway, now that that's settled...

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:11.660
Wait! Before you go...

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:13.870
Could you take this off?

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:25.720
Yahoo! I'm coming right now, Annelotte-neenee!

00:23:10.030 --> 00:23:40.060
Next Time

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:13.120
I was kind of surprised that the knight

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:15.370
from my premonition was missing some parts and

00:23:15.370 --> 00:23:17.040
had a few added elsewhere!

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:19.040
But Annelotte-neenee is so

00:23:19.040 --> 00:23:21.500
cool, gallant, and wonderful.

00:23:21.500 --> 00:23:24.250
I knew she was fated to be "the one!"

00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:26.500
So the next time we meet,

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:29.510
I think I'll give her a big present.

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:32.640
Next Time: "The Unstopping Hyper Vibration."

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:37.930
Hey, Valkyrie, your armour looks pretty well-made.

00:23:37.930 --> 00:23:39.600
You think I could borrow it?
